of=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond%20Arena\">Svargrond Arena</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThe Dark Dancer attacks from a distance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDon´t take off your <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarven%20Ring\">Dwarven Ring</a> if you are using one from your last battle. It is very probable that you are still drunk, also its best to ignore the ghouls she summons.<br/> Druid or Sorcerer: use <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a>, and get a little closer to The Dark Dancer to corner her where you will know her position even if she goes invisible, shoot Explosion when invisible and SD when visible.<br/>Knight: Stay diagonal right next to her in a corner, use Exori to make her visible and melee her.<br/>Paladin: Use Explosion to make her visible and shoot, may be a good idea to shoot <a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Spear\">Ethereal Spear</a> since most of your mana will be drained anyway.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Necromancers\">Necromancers</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Acolyte%20of%20Darkness\">Acolyte of Darkness</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Hand\">Blood Hand</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blood%20Priest\">Blood Priest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bride%20of%20Night\">Bride of Night</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer%20Servant\">Necromancer Servant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestess</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shadow%20Pupil\">Shadow Pupil</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["barbarian-arena-quest"]}